under replication (Spearman $\rho = \statSpearmanRhoSeeded$, 95\% bootstrap CI
$[\statSpearmanCILoSeeded, \statSpearmanCIHiSeeded]$). The interval excludes
zero, confirming the direction, while the small magnitude reinforces that
validation loss is an unreliable selection criterion for interaction recovery.


